Better to put '[PATCH 4.9.y]' prefix in the subject to make clear that
it's only for 4.9.y.

Also, the line indicating the upstream commit id is:

  commit $ID upstream.

Last but not least, if you resubmit the patch, you must give your own
sign-off, too.


